SELECT note, COUNT(*) FROM payments.pos_payments
WHERE note ILIKE '%stock%' OR note ILIKE '%atta%' OR note ILIKE '%out%' OR note ILIKE '%shelf%'
GROUP BY note ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 20;

SELECT bill_ts, bill_id, qty FROM store.pos_lines
WHERE sku_scanned='ATTA-WW-5KG' AND bill_ts::date BETWEEN '2026-06-23' AND '2026-06-24'
ORDER BY bill_ts;

SELECT date, sku, units_sold FROM store.daily_sales
WHERE date BETWEEN '2026-06-22' AND '2026-06-28' AND sku LIKE 'ATTA%'
ORDER BY date, sku;
